data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Now I need to:\n1. Merge the verified application into my own branch (already done - it's merged via fast-forward)\n2. The server is already running on 0.0.0.0:5173\n3. Confirm the page still loads\n4. Reply to m1 with outcome campaign-met\n\nWait, I already merged the developer work into my branch. QA verified the same commit (refs/campaign/orchestrator points to my HEAD). So the verified app is already on my branch. Good.\n\nNow I need to make sure the server is still running and the page loads. The dev server is running. Let me verify.\n\nI should also make sure everything is committed. My branch should have the final state. Let me check git status and log."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849677,"id":"chatcmpl-b87b39c2b5934dcb95e7698e8d1f0b91","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

